"""A small recursive-descent evaluator for integer/float arithmetic expressions.

Supported grammar (precedence lowest to highest):

    expr   := term (('+' | '-') term)*
    term   := factor (('*' | '/' | '//' | '%') factor)*
    factor := ('+' | '-') factor | power
    power  := atom ['**' factor]
    atom   := INTEGER | '(' expr ')'

